# Bun + search index

**Bun** is the package manager and script runner (`bun.lock`, `packageManager` in `package.json`).

- Use `bun install` and `bun run <script>` — not npm/pnpm/yarn.
- Do not update or rely on `package-lock.json`.

## `bun run index:search`

Rebuilds Pagefind into `static/pagefind/` for local/dev search.

Run when: first clone, missing index, or searchable content changed (dictionary/grammar/cases/pronunciation/lessons/practice).

For `/downloads` local builder: also run `bun scripts/downloads/export.ts` when `static/downloads/` is missing (regenerated on `astro build` too). Export is learner-facing: spelled lemmas + SK/EN examples (no internal `note` / `tatoebaId` / `demonstrates`).

Skip for pure UI/layout work. `bun run build` already regenerates the index for production.

Full detail: root `AGENTS.md`.
